#X floatatom 360 6366 6 0 10 0 - - -;
#X msg 360 6390 l2f \$1;
#X text 82 6420 l2r \, l3r (2): rate 0.01-50 Hz. \; l2w \, l3w (0): wave 0 triangle \, 1 sine \, 2 saw up \, 3 saw down \, 4 square \, 5 sample & hold (a new random value each cycle). \; l2k \, l3k (0): retrigger: 0 free running \, 1 every key restarts the wave \, 2 only the first key of a phrase. \; l2f \, l3f (0): fade-in after a retrigger \, 0-10 s. \;   \; Targets (number name: parameter \, range at amount 127): \; 0 off: no target \; 1 pitch: pitch \, both DCOs +-24 semitones \; 2 pitch2: pitch DCO2 +-48 semitones \; 3 detn: detune DCO2 +-50 cents \; 4 har1: timbre DCO1 +-127 steps \; 5 har2: timbre DCO2 +-127 steps \; 6 wsh1: Walsh position DCO1 +-127 steps \; 7 wsh2: Walsh position DCO2 +-127 steps \; 8 wmx1: Walsh mix DCO1 +-127 \; 9 wmx2: Walsh mix DCO2 +-127 \; 10 pw1: pulse width DCO1 +-47 % \; 11 pw2: pulse width DCO2 +-47 % \; 12 fm1: FM depth DCO1 +-16 index \; 13 fm2: FM depth DCO2 +-16 index \; 14 fmr: FM ratio x/: 4 \; 15 ring: ring modulation amount +-127 \; 16 swe: sync sweep depth +-72 semitones \; 17 lev1: level DCO1 +-127 \; 18 lev2: level DCO2 +-127 \; 19 amp: output level x 0..2 (tremolo) \; 20 pan: balance left / right \; 21 nois: noise level +-15 \; 22 cut: cutoff filter +-8 octaves \; 23 res: resonance filter +-15 \; 24 drv: overdrive +-127 \; 25 mgr: MG rate x/: 8 \; 26 mgi: MG pitch depth +-200 cents \; 27 l2r: LFO2 rate x/: 8, f 64;
#X obj 460 7024 s \$0-pdoly8;
